# Kept out of ripgrep searches (Claude Code's Grep tool reads this file; git and Unity don't).
# These are one-line minified tables or third-party code: a search hit dumps the whole thing.
# To search them anyway: grep -r in a shell (or rg --no-ignore), or read the file directly.

